    // NEW Mutation Q: quadratic dead-space amplification — when the current
    // item leaves a leftover that the lookahead item cannot use at all, the
    // stranded fraction compounds over future steps; penalize superlinearly
    // when the stranded chunk is neither tiny (closable) nor large (usable).
