    // Mutation Q (new): post-residual granularity targeting — after seating both
    // the current and lookahead item, reward leftovers that land in the tight
    // reusable windows (1..=12 or exactly matching mean_residual), which are
    // statistically most likely to be filled by later items; this directly
    // attacks the dead-space ratio metric.
